    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok so if the risk transfers once they're loaded in seoul, does the seller still have to deal with anything if the ship encounters problems in the middle of the ocean? like if the cargo gets damaged before it hits hamburg, who is ultimately liable for the insurance claim process?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
