      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While the risk has transferred to you (the buyer) once loaded in Seoul, the seller must have arranged the minimum required insurance under CIF. For claims involving damage at sea, you, the buyer, must initiate the insurance claim process using the cover the seller arranged. However, the seller is contractually obligated to provide you with the insurance documents to allow you to file that claim.",
      "source": "target",
